{%- comment -%}
  Site hook, included by al_folio_core's _layouts/bib.liquid once the venue
  text (`entrytype`) is assembled. Bolds the acronym that ends a booktitle,
  "... Economics and Computation (EC)" -> "... (<strong>EC</strong>)".
  Journal names carry no acronym and are left alone.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if entry.booktitle contains '(' -%}
  {%- assign venue_acronym = entry.booktitle | split: '(' | last | split: ')' | first -%}
  {%- capture venue_plain -%}({{ venue_acronym }})</em>{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture venue_bold -%}(<strong>{{ venue_acronym }}</strong>)</em>{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign entrytype = entrytype | replace: venue_plain, venue_bold -%}
{%- endif -%}
